{"file":"agent-context-kit-1.0.0-v1.zip","bytes":52829,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"agent-context-kit","description":"Four Agent Skills (directives, how-tos, scripts, context-refactor) that give a coding agent persistent, discoverable context about a codebase, instead of re-deriving it every session.","version":"1.0.0","license":"MIT"}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/context-refactor/SKILL.md","name":"context-refactor","description":"Review and guide refactors across a project's directives, how-tos, and scripts systems, catching cross-cutting problems no single one of those skills can see on its own: a section embedded in the wrong kind of doc, a directive with no backing enforcement script, a doc or script living at the wrong level of the directory tree, or near-duplicate scripts that are candidates for hoisting into one parametric script. Presents findings as a numbered, impact-ordered menu and walks through them one guided change at a time. Use when the user wants a cross-system audit or wants to plan a refactor that spans docs/ how-tos/ and scripts/ folders.","headings":["How this differs from the other three skills' `maintain` modes","Starting every invocation","Scope","Phase 1 — Full-content inventory","Phase 2 — Cross-cutting analysis","Category 1 — Type misclassification","Category 2 — Enforcement gaps","Category 3 — Placement / hierarchy level","Category 4 — Duplication candidate for generalization","Phase 3 — Present findings menu","Phase 4 — Guided single-change loop","Phase 5 — Summary"],"name_hint":"上下文 · refactor","description_zh":"跨项目 directives、how-tos 和 scripts 审查文档错位、缺少执行脚本、目录层级与重复脚本等问题，输出按影响排序的编号菜单并逐项指导重构。"},{"path":"skills/directives/SKILL.md","name":"directives","description":"Manage project directive docs in docs/ folders. Use when the user wants to add or update conventions/standards documents, audit the directive system for quality, or find which directives are relevant to a task. Modes: add, update, maintain, context, suggest.","headings":["Skill-bundled default docs","Directive doc frontmatter","Starting every invocation","Modes","`add <path> \"<intent>\"`","`update <path> \"<intent>\"`","`maintain`","`context \"<task description>\"`","`suggest`","AGENTS.md instruction","Directives","Impact assessment (add / update modes)","Git conventions","Large refactors"],"name_hint":"directives","description_zh":"管理 docs 目录中的项目规范与标准文档，支持新增、更新、维护、相关规范查找和建议。"},{"path":"skills/how-tos/SKILL.md","name":"how-tos","description":"Manage project how-to docs in how-tos/ folders — step-by-step operational procedures (deploy, generate an access token, compile, rotate credentials, run a database migration, ...). Use when the user wants to add or update a procedure doc, audit the how-to system for quality, or find how to carry out an operational task. Modes: add, update, maintain, context, suggest.","headings":["How this differs from `directives` and `scripts`","How-to doc frontmatter","Deferring to `scripts`","Starting every invocation","Modes","`add <path> \"<intent>\"`","`update <path> \"<intent>\"`","`maintain`","`context \"<task description>\"`","`suggest`","AGENTS.md instruction","How-Tos"],"name_hint":"how · tos","description_zh":"管理 how-tos 目录的逐步操作文档，包括部署、令牌生成、编译、凭据轮换和数据库迁移，支持新增、更新、质量审计、查找和建议。"},{"path":"skills/scripts/SKILL.md","name":"scripts","description":"Discover, understand, run, and scaffold automation scripts in scripts/ folders. Use when the user wants to find a script for a task, run a script, add a new script, audit existing scripts, or get suggestions for scripts to automate repeated work. Modes: context, run, add, maintain, suggest.","headings":["The `--help` requirement","Optional tags header","tags: [tag1, tag2]","Starting every invocation","Modes","`context \"<task description>\"`","`run <script> [args]`","`add <path> \"<intent>\"`","`maintain`","`suggest`","AGENTS.md instruction","Scripts"],"name_hint":"scripts","description_zh":"发现、理解、运行或搭建 scripts 目录中的自动化脚本，支持按任务查找、执行、新增、维护和重复工作自动化建议。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["agent-context-kit","Why this exists","Requirements","Install","Primary: any agent, via `npx skills`","Claude Code plugin marketplace","Use in a project","Bundled default directives","Development","Author","License"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".github/workflows/ci.yml",".gitignore","AGENTS.md","CLAUDE.md","Containerfile","LICENSE","README.md","compose.yaml","docs/install-conventions.md","docs/os-independence.md","docs/skill-content-portability.md","how-tos/install-skills.md","how-tos/run-tests.md","scripts/dev","skills/context-refactor/SKILL.md","skills/directives/SKILL.md","skills/directives/docs/hierarchical-verification.md","skills/directives/docs/out-of-tree-artifacts.md","skills/directives/docs/tools-over-judgment.md","skills/directives/scripts/describe_docs.py","skills/directives/scripts/discover_docs.py","skills/how-tos/SKILL.md","skills/how-tos/scripts/describe_docs.py","skills/how-tos/scripts/discover_docs.py","skills/scripts/SKILL.md","skills/scripts/scripts/describe_scripts.py","skills/scripts/scripts/discover_scripts.py","tests/test_directives_scripts.py","tests/test_help_contract.py","tests/test_how_tos_scripts.py","tests/test_npx_skills_install.py","tests/test_repo_docs_frontmatter.py","tests/test_scripts_skill.py","tests/test_skill_frontmatter.py","tests/util.py"],"sha256":"b552598037957a9614ab83f26e4b707459fbeac1b58198bb1f69918d15d83ddd","scanner_version":3,"file_count":37,"name":"agent-context-kit","category":"软件开发与测试","topic":"记忆、上下文与会话交接","summary_zh":"为编码智能体整理代码库指令、操作说明、脚本和上下文重构资料，形成跨会话持续可发现的项目上下文。","description":"Four Agent Skills (directives, how-tos, scripts, context-refactor) that give a coding agent persistent, discoverable context about a codebase, instead of re-deriving it every session.","themes":["代码检索、讲解与重构","上下文压缩与Token","会话交接与恢复"],"platforms":["Claude插件","Agent技能"],"coun